{"turns": [
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom. My name is Lucy. How can I help you today?",
    "tags": ["greeting"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Hello Lucy, mera network issue ho raha hai. Call drop ho rahe hain and internet speed is very slow. Please check karo.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "I need your account number to access your details. Please provide it.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Haan, mera account number hai 11527375. My name is Vivek Das.",
    "tags": ["identity_verification"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "Thank you. I am checking the network status in your area.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Yeh problem kaafi time se chal rahi hai. I am very frustrated with this service. Please solve it quickly.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "The system shows no outage in your location. Everything is working fine on our end.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "Fine on your end? Are you kidding me? Mere ghar pe signal bars are almost zero. It is impossible to work from home!",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "You can try restarting your phone or checking your SIM card settings.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer", "text": "Maine restart kiya hai and SIM card bhi change kiya. I have tried everything. Aap log sirf generic answers dete ho. This is ridiculous!",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "There are no technical faults reported in the area. I cannot do anything more from here.",
    "tags": []
  },
  {
    "speaker": "customer",
    "text": "What? Nothing fixed? Main toh port out karunga. I will switch to another provider because this is useless.",
    "tags": ["churn_signal"]
  },
  {
    "speaker": "agent",
    "text": "That is your choice. Is there anything else I can help you with today?",
    "tags": ["closure"]
  }
]}
